{% aside type="note" title="The invoice itself is always in English" %}
The invoice that the client receives (the PDF, the online copy and the paper shown in the editor) is always in English, whatever interface language you use. Only the screens around it follow your interface language.
{% /aside %}

{% aside type="note" title="Examples in this chapter" %}
All firms, companies, people, amounts and invoice numbers in this chapter are fictional. The example firm is SAMPLE ACCOUNTING FIRM, and the example client is ABC PTE. LTD. (UEN 201900001A). Amounts are in SGD, and the issuing entity is registered for GST at 9%.
{% /aside %}
